                                                "text": "But what to do about a kid who flashes his privates at your child? And worse, how do you make sure your kid does not reciprocate? That's exactly the dilemma one mom faced when she learned that her 5-year-old neighbor had flashed his \"junk\" at her two sons and then made them swear not to tell."
                                            },
